.Sh CAVEATS
Calling
.Fa destroy
on a page allocator calls a null pointer.
.Pp
.Fn xft_alloc_clone
must be called with a pointer to the
.Vt t_allocator ,
not with its
.Fa allocator
member.
.Fa buffer Ns .size
must be nonzero.
Through an arena the requested alignment equals the rounded size, so cloning
large buffers wastes up to that many bytes of padding.
